{"id":"wb-7-1063","name":"旌德文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"旌德文庙","text":"旌德文庙位于中国安徽省宣城市旌德县旌阳镇营坎路，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n旌德文庙始建于北宋，元、明、清及民国年间均有过修缮，占地面积4655.21平方米，建筑面积1463.81平方米。旌德文庙坐北朝南，由泮池泮桥、戟门、名宦祠、乡贤祠、东庑、西庑、东斋房、西斋房、大成殿、文昌塔等建筑组成。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%97%8C%E5%BE%B7%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":84928994,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84928994","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d71c5c313bce3bf764cd9bf8.jpg","title":"Jingde_Confucian_Temple,_2021-09-27_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jingde_Confucian_Temple,_2021-09-27_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Jingde_Confucian_Temple%2C_2021-09-27_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​旌德文庙及文峰塔","width":320,"height":214}}